{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:55 2026-10-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:55 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:55 2026-10-27 HKT</p><p>今（27日）早10時許，筲箕灣道318號西行線對開路面一個道路工程，期間懷疑工人掘爆水管，大量水湧出路面，並湧入附近一間安老院舍，院舍被沖爆一塊玻璃，一名婆婆腳傷須送院治理。黃泥水浸滿行人路及筲箕灣道來回行車線，猶如澤國，駛經的車輛及行人均須涉水而行。工人接報到場進行搶修。</p><img alt=\"路面噴出水柱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27845a076fa4f136be512a2b97a548a1/2026-10/c_0_6.jpg\"/><img alt=\"行車線成澤國。fb筲箕灣西灣河關注組圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84b7bca985e74b9b5b75fd77c799028a/2026-10/40423ae6-dd54-4309-ab8f-c6da08d1be70.jpg\"/><img alt=\"路面湧出水柱。fb筲箕灣西灣河關注組圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7849e6b82864bdfc97d6aba8c466ea8/2026-10/4024ff2b-937d-4608-8598-93b011f26e4e.jpg\"/><img alt=\"fb筲箕灣西灣河關注組圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/222f82a3eb0f5d02d03d41ff2de41ccd/2026-10/c21188c5-aaaf-407b-a888-625309fafefb.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:00:50.656241+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:55:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:31.958029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:31.958029+00:00","content_hash":"cba2bbca16122a2b50ab1e80d73d184c127a49a343dbb16732138d9facd2d4f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}